      "title": "非标量枚举值导致 TypeError 逃出 determine_case（11 个站点）",
      "detail": "criterion/reason/basis、effective_temporal.availability/as_of_source/observed_from/code、document_versions[].code、empty_use.code/turn_status、source_evidence.completeness_status 以 JSON 数组/对象传入时，`value in frozenset` 抛 TypeError；determine_case 只捕 AdapterError。同一字段给 hashable 错值则正常返回固定码。与模块 docstring『不抛裸异常』及开发报告『所有错误收敛为固定码』矛盾。",
      "evidence": "independent/out/05-failclosed.json#non_scalar_enum_sites; independent-review.md §5.2",
      "recommendation": "作为 M-C1P4-01 硬条件：成员判断前 isinstance(str)，或 determine_case 额外捕 TypeError → *_field_invalid:<path> + unknown",
      "owner": "P4"
